ress resilience and lack of crew cooperation info. Also reference earlier discussion about B and C. Provide reasoning.\n\nThus: \"I appreciate James's note on D's adequate stress resilience and strong problem solving, but his moody, loner traits raise concerns about crew cooperation, which we have no evidence for but likely problematic. Compared to B's strong stress handling and conscientiousness, D is weaker. So I maintain vote for B.\"\n\nLet's produce final."}
